      "address": "5024 W. Chinden Blvd., Garden City, ID 83714",
      "description": "Boise's 24/7 Animal Emergency Hospital and Specialty Center Recognized as one of the most progressive veterinary hospitals in the Northwest, WestVet Boise is part of MedVet’s nationwide network of veterinarian owned and led hospitals, offering the most advanced emergency and specialty veterinary care in the region. Our team of experts, many of whom are board-certified specialists, works tirelessly to provide exceptional and compassionate care to thousands of pets each year. We treat every pet as if they were our own because we know they’re an important part of your family. And our caregivers partner with your family veterinarian to ensure a complete circle of care for your pet. We know pets are family! While our healthcare teams provide medical care for each pet who walks through our hospital doors, our Veterinary Social Work team supports the people and families who love them. Facing an emergency? Bring your dog or cat directly to WestVet Boise – no appointment is ever needed for emergency veterinary care. Our trusted WestVet team is available 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.",
